\title{Decrypting messages with RSA}
\date{2026-07-17T12:34:27Z}
\tag{discrete}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{To \strong{decrypt} the encrypted message #{C}, the recipient simply does the [same thing](00IJ) but using their private key #{d} as the exponent instead of #{e}! That is, they compute #{C^d \mod n}.}

